{"summary":"静态阅读学生代码：表头校验、CSV解析、行有效性、空有效集返回和纯函数边界基本符合任务；但分类计数使用 `if not duration`，会把已知的0分钟误判为未知，导致 known_duration_count、known_minutes 和 missing_duration_count 在0分钟行上出错。未执行代码，结论仅基于静态文本。","overall":"needs_changes","criteria":[{"criterion_id":"C01","verdict":"pass","reason":"使用 csv.DictReader 读取后检查 fieldnames，缺失必需列或表头为空时抛出 ValueError，符合缺表头约束。"},{"criterion_id":"C02","verdict":"pass","reason":"使用 csv 模块解析引号字段；逐行校验 record_id 可转 int 且大于0，分钟空白视为未知，非空须可转 int 且在0至1440，非法行计入 invalid_count 并跳过。"},{"criterion_id":"C03","verdict":"fail","issue_type":"zero_as_missing","evidence_span":"        if not duration:
            out["missing_duration_count"] += 1","reason":"duration 为已知整数0时 `not duration` 为真，被计入 missing_duration_count，未计入 known_duration_count，混淆了已知0与未知空白。","next_action":"将分类条件改为显式判断 duration is None：None 时计 missing_duration_count，否则计 known_duration_count 并累加分钟。","suggested_self_test":"用输入 `record_id,duration_minutes\n1,0\n2,\n` 调用函数，检查 known_duration_count 为1、known_minutes 为0、missing_duration_count 为1。"},{"criterion_id":"C04","verdict":"fail","issue_type":"sum_error","evidence_span":"        if not duration:
            out["missing_duration_count"] += 1
        else:
            out["known_duration_count"] += 1
            out["known_minutes"] += duration","reason":"已知0分钟因 `not duration` 进入 missing 分支，未执行 known_minutes 累加；虽然加0不改变和，但该行未被当作已知分钟处理，累加逻辑对0值分类错误。","next_action":"在确认 duration is not None 后累加 duration，使已知0也走累加路径。","suggested_self_test":"用输入 `record_id,duration_minutes\n1,0\n2,30\n` 调用函数，检查 known_minutes 为30且 known_duration_count 为2。"},{"criterion_id":"C05","verdict":"pass","reason":"out 字典在循环前初始化五个整数字段，无有效行时直接返回完整五字段，符合空有效集契约。"},{"criterion_id":"C06","verdict":"pass","reason":"函数仅使用 csv、io 和内存字符串处理，不读写文件、不联网、不执行任意代码，符合纯函数静态边界。"}]}
